00:20:50.740 --> 00:20:55.559
I will just walk you through briefly what
it does.

00:20:55.559 --> 00:21:02.100
dbSNP is part of the Entrez system that allows
you to search across not just dbSNP but all

00:21:02.100 --> 00:21:07.880
the databases and link all the information
together so this example what it does is it

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:12.279
searches for the gene of interest in the Gene
database and then it uses that information

00:21:12.279 --> 00:21:19.779
to search dbSNP and then extract the frequency
data.

00:21:19.779 --> 00:21:21.970
These are the codes.

00:21:21.970 --> 00:21:31.029
